{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## F18 GREEN milestone\n\nUpdated only `docs/user-guide.md`. Mutation output now describes client options and channels without router detail. Bug causation now describes `caused_by`, explicit attribution, preservation, derivation, and non-blocking close behavior without blame-selection detail. Credential guidance now provides current prevention, refusal, override, and rotation actions without the dated incident narrative. Session logs now describe creation, reuse, rotation, discovery, and exclusions without pointer resolution.\n\nThe focused RED contract now passes. Ticket checks passed, including 19 focused contracts. Shared documentation generators changed no derived files. The documentation-only lane passed with 3,179 tests and 15 skips. Lint, typecheck, and diff checks passed. No full-suite run was performed because the change is Markdown-only."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787529395044595001,"uuid":"23751865-ea7e-4333-b9cd-7710698b1541"}